+// Default non-zero so UNCOLORIZED screens pass through (show the original DMD)
+// instead of freezing on the last colorized frame. Upstream defaults to 0 and
+// relies on the host to call Serum_SetMaximumUnknownFramesToSkip; the VPX BGFX
+// plugin-serum never does, so without this default a frame with no trigger match
+// hangs forever. 20 frames bridges brief intra-animation gaps yet passes through
+// a genuinely uncolorized screen in a fraction of a second. (Tunable: rom-workbench
+// vendor/patches/0002-passthrough-unknown-frames.patch.)
+uint8_t maxFramesToSkip = 20;
